//! Entries slice 112 — Batch 259 (2026-10-20, Plan 263 / Research 295): the
//! uzu e744e7c chunked-GDN prefill pack — the per-tile packed conv history
//! plus the in-place register-window tile scan, the per-row transcendental
//! hoist, and the precompute-chain fusion whose global intermediates (kk, `a_packed`,
//! `a_inv`) are never born. Every quote re-verified VERBATIM at the pin
